# content sets on EVERY payload (design/SHAPES.md, "Content sets")
#   guard: on
#   init-guard: on
#   arms: prost | core-native | core-ffi-rust. The two validating encode arms
#         are NOT here: decision 3 settled and encode no longer validates, so
#         they would be priced against a path nothing takes. content.rs keeps
#         them for the record on P1.2 and P2.2.
#   P1.3 and P2.5 are the ABSENT-PATH CONTROLS: their rows must barely move.

