# `/ its ascii` is the same arm against ITSELF on the ascii set, so it isolates
# what the content costs that arm with the arm held constant. R4's sharpened
# half says to prefer that form: this slice has already seen a within-arm delta
# reproduce across builds where the ratio to a third arm drifted.
